    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4c14b3f9-35b6-37cd-baee-5c105e017fcc",
                "word": "noumenal",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "31a6107d-420a-3896-b98a-6b0995fb9139",
                        "entry_id": "4c14b3f9-35b6-37cd-baee-5c105e017fcc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to the noumenon or the realm of things as they are in themselves."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially",
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e3bb2c9-1199-4e60-904c-19f63fc8d41c",
                                "sense_id": "31a6107d-420a-3896-b98a-6b0995fb9139",
                                "text": "We may here distinguish between two kinds of reality, phenomenal or relative, and noumenal or absolute."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14cdcc36-7e94-431a-856a-f07e484186fb",
                                "sense_id": "31a6107d-420a-3896-b98a-6b0995fb9139",
                                "text": "Nor can the elements of the phenomenal world derive any complexity from the interaction of the noumenal elements which they represent with the complex structure of the precipients."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9651d6de-c464-4ce8-bc0a-7ff45e3375f3",
                                "sense_id": "31a6107d-420a-3896-b98a-6b0995fb9139",
                                "text": "When Kant says that it is impossible to know anything about, or apply any categories to, the noumenal realm, he would seem to be doing just what cannot be done."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0bb32750-e44b-424e-a18a-b4a8688bb38e",
                        "source_entry_id": "4c14b3f9-35b6-37cd-baee-5c105e017fcc",
                        "source_sense_id": "31a6107d-420a-3896-b98a-6b0995fb9139",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or pertaining to the noumenon",
                        "target_lang_word": "nouménal",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nouménal",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5deeac9e-297b-3fe4-8e49-4dcf1115ba0e",
                                        "entry_id": "dab0d7f0-9608-39df-8d8a-73f30a0f5537",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a rapport aux noumènes, aux choses telles qu’elles sont en soi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e42ee0e-0408-4d95-a9d9-a38e5e6147cb",
                                                "sense_id": "5deeac9e-297b-3fe4-8e49-4dcf1115ba0e",
                                                "text": "Les questions de goût, la beauté etc., concernent des faits nouménaux, inaccessibles par nature à la connaissance scientifique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad6c5fad-0a7c-43e7-9183-1f7ecd1b47fa",
                                                "sense_id": "5deeac9e-297b-3fe4-8e49-4dcf1115ba0e",
                                                "text": "— Alors les bouts rimés ou non, que nous composâmes, furent une affirmation dans l’absolu, hors de l’étendue et de la durée. Il convient d’en être fier ; mais des hommes à passions chercheraient une vengeance moins exclusivement nouménale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebb86e55-e4f6-4513-aad7-51f6848b459d",
                                                "sense_id": "5deeac9e-297b-3fe4-8e49-4dcf1115ba0e",
                                                "text": "L’histoire de ce refoulement, l’odyssée de cet évincement, l’épopée de cette mise à l’écart, l’aventure de ce déni constituent à elles seules la matière de véritables encyclopédies : (...) mobilisation de la majeure partie de la philosophie occidentale au profit du monde intelligible, de la substance pensante, du registre nouménal au détriment du monde sensible, de la substance étendue ou du monde phénoménal (...)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
